<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Silgan Holdings raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Silgan Holdings raised.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it upgraded Silgan Holdings Inc to strong buy from buy.</p>
<p>-- said the company has been beating estimates and the first quarter was very strong.</p>
<p>-- believes there could be an upside to the 1997 earnings estimate of $2.00 a share and 1998 estimate of $2.50 a share.</p>
<p>-- said one-year price target is $35 a share.</p>
<p>-- said added Silgan to its small-capitalization recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Silgan was up 3/4 to 26.</p>
</text>
